  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with imagenet_vit_l image encoder and weighted fusion (config_039) achieve high accuracy (0.725). This experiment tests scgpt RNA encoder with the same image encoder and transformer aggregation but uses concat fusion. It isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice and fusion method, addressing uncertainty about whether these factors outweigh the benefits of the strong image encoder. This comparison helps determine if weighted fusion is critical or if the RNA encoder's quality is the limiting factor."
}

